Z||000003||Black88GT||02-25-2001||02:39 PM||||I know someone looking for a turbo from a starion or Conquest TSI.  If you decide to not try and install it in your Fiero, email me with an asking price.<P><BR>thanks||||reg||1
Z||000004||Will||02-25-2001||02:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by v8fieroGT:<BR><B>ok, i never tried this so i hope i don't sound too stupid.I have a mitsubishi starion that has a whole turbo system in it.I was wondering if any turbo can be put into anycar(fiero).If so what do i need to do it. Any info about this would be appreaciated.thanks</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Any turbo can be put into any car. YMMV. Putting a turbo from a 6V96T on your Iron Duck isnt likely to give good results, but as long as you exercise comon sense in turbo selection and matching it can be done with good results.<BR>Basically, you need to do what Dennis Lagrua did: <A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nbci.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm</A> <P>||||reg||1
