Z||000006||Predator||02-26-2001||08:00 AM||||When I installed my Turbo Kit it was recommended that I install a high volume oil pump as well. It seems to be a good idea. The stock fuel system can handle a turbo setup up to 225 hp from what I was told so you can do it without rebuilding your fuel system. A fuel/air guage is highly recommended as well. Good luck. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
